WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:04.580
April 20, 1648 Testament Era
4:58 A.M., Tadakatsu Honda Manor, Mikawa

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:10.420
4:58 A.M.
Futayo Honda’s Room

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.590
That morning was the same as any other.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.040
Nothing truly stood out.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:28.400
Let us pass, let us pass

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:28.400
Toorimase, toorimase

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.620
Everything looked like normal.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:30.570
I thought days such as this would last forever,

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:35.500
Where doth this narrow path lead?

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:35.500
Ikaba izuko ga hosomichi nareba

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:33.330
but they shatter as they draw to an end.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:42.320
It doth lead to the gods in Heaven

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:42.320
Tenjin moto he to itaru hosomichi

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:48.840
Thou thoughts matter not for ye cannot pass

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:48.840
Goiken gomuyou toorenu totemo

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:46.070
When the time comes, I...

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:12.250
What do you see?

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:12.250
Nani ga mieru?

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:15.670
You've closed yourself off to love

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:15.670
Ari no mama no kimi wa

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:21.560
Until you grow innately strong

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:21.560
Tsuyoku naru made itoshisa wo tojite

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:24.640
What are you listening to?

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:24.640
Nani wo kiku no?

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:27.730
Shall I tell you about days long past

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:27.730
Himitsu no kobeya de

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:33.570
In our secret little room?

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:33.570
Inishie no hibi katarou ka?

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:36.780
Embraced in memories

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:36.780
Kioku ni dakarete

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.070
The mysteria crumbles

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.070
Kudakareta mysteria

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:42.830
Once you overcome this tragedy

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:42.830
Higeki wo koete

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.040
Offer a gentle prayer

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.040
Odayaka na inori

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:49.060
Endings are just beginnings

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:49.060
Owari ga hajimari

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:52.250
People toss aside all they have

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:52.250
Shinsekai de hito wa mirai wo

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.840
Without ever knowing

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.840
Bishu no you ni

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.310
If they could drink up the new world

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.310
Nomi hoseru ka sae shirazu

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:01.470
Like a savory wine

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:01.470
Subete houri nageta

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:04.630
The new world resides

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:04.630
Shinsekai wa tsumetai risei to

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:07.350
Between boring logic and miracles

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:07.350
Kiseki no hazama

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:16.360
I wonder why this is where I first met you

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:16.360
Doushite koko de kimi to aeta no

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:24.010
2:12 P.M.
Highway to Kakamigahara Checkpoint No.1, Mikawa

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:31.610
Covert Ops Under the Night Sky

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:42.450
2:17 P.M.
Highway to Kakamigahara Checkpoint No.1, Mikawa

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:43.970
Show me!

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:48.520
Score!

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.760
2:53 P.M.
Diner on the Outskirts of Mikawa

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:02.230
Dang, Sakai!

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:05.870
You're still groping girls' butts in battle?

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:11.000
People don't usually sic their kid
on their big-shot buddy either.

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:12.820
Futayo, was it?

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:14.840
You're one tough cookie!

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:18.420
Father, could you properly introduce us?

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:22.060
Oh, me? I'm Tadatsugu Sakai,

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:24.810
the real leader of the Four Divine Matsudaira Kings.

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:25.970
Back in the day,

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.190
Lord Motonobu Matsudaira was the school president

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:29.850
and eternal student council president.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:33.840
I was the chancellor and your dad was
the commando unit's captain.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.870
I was vice-president, moron!

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:38.260
Ii was the vice-president

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:41.730
and Sakakibara here was nothing but talk.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:44.110
That's not true!

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:47.830
I was the clerk and an expert in the humanities.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:52.870
Girlie, isn't it time you overcame your
athlete father's brainwashing?

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.500
Girlie?

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.460
Care to enter my academy?

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.900
I'm dying to enroll someone like you!

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.090
Masazumi Honda's there, remember her?

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:06.340
I have not seen Masazumi since middle school,

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:08.480
but I heard she moved to Musashi.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.940
Isn't she the vice-president?

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:13.580
She sure is! So, why don't you enroll?

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:16.050
I am honored by your offer, but...

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:16.940
Hold it, Sakai.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:21.400
Futayo is currently working as the
colonel of the Mikawa Guard.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:22.790
Wow!

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:25.580
Colonel in the only Far East armed force

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.660
approved of by the Testament Union, eh?

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.660
Intrigued?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:30.490
Actually,

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:36.020
Futayo is leaving Mikawa on a Vanguard soon
to ensure Musashi's safety

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:38.090
through the corridor to Aki.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:42.180
I've told her she may do as she pleases
once she reaches Aki.

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:43.270
Meaning?

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:46.640
My father and I decided I should
decide everything for myself.

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:50.560
So Sakai, save the invitation until then.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:55.170
I'm sure Futayo will accept if she feels
she needs you or Musashi.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.970
The world is ready for change

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:00.980
and I want my daughter to decide her own moves.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:06.800
I see...

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:12.000
Peerless Man of the East, Tadakatsu Honda's
prized warrior is heading out

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.210
just as Peerless Man of the West,
Muneshige Tachibana

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:18.080
is succeeding that name in Tres España.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.000
Kazuno?!

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.340
I see it is none other than Master Sakai.

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:32.640
Dacchan, you're still letting her live with you?

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:34.220
I don't have a choice!

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:37.360
No one can replicate my wife's cooking

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:40.060
or swordplay quite like her.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.840
Plus, she has perfectly good etiquette.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:43.940
Judge.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:47.730
I am currently teaching Lady Futayo the basics.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.530
Lady Futayo is a mature woman now,

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:53.240
but Master Tadakatsu still tries to bathe with her

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.070
or take her to a grill.

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:56.510
He's most deplorable.

00:05:57.110 --> 00:06:01.190
His nickname "Dacchan"
is short for "deplorable human."

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:06.880
Do no speak ill of Master Tadakatsu.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:10.420
Dacchan, she still has that demonic rule

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:12.760
where she's the only one allowed to diss you?!

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:18.430
Master Tadakatsu, it is time to prepare the ship.

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:20.430
Judge, judge.

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:23.640
Well, I'm off.

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:25.960
Keep up the good work!

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:30.590
5:30 P.M.
In Front of the Diner on the Outskirts of Mikawa

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:33.600
Sakakibara, tell me two things.

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:36.210
Tell me about Ii.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:40.060
Does his no-show today mean
something happened to him?

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:44.920
And there's an automated doll
named P-01s on Musashi.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:49.360
She boarded from Mikawa last year,
so what's her deal?

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:54.890
Sakai, do you know of the spirited away
incidents called the "Lost Nobles"?

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.960
6:09 P.M.
Above the Normal Land Port, Mikawa

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.430
6:11 P.M.
Prefecture Highway 79, Mikawa

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:12.490
So, she's gone...

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:16.840
A Tres España Inquisition Warship
came in as they were departing.

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:18.330
In that case...

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:21.290
Muneshige Tachibana should be aboard.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.930
How exciting,

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:26.590
although I will never get the chance
to see Futayo fight him.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:29.630
Master Tadakatsu, it is time.

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:32.790
Got it, I'll be quick.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:40.480
We shall hereby begin preparing the fireworks.

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:44.340
Everyone, please commence your assigned tasks.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:52.500
Lord Motonobu, things are proceeding as planned.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:55.450
They'll find out about the fireworks at just past eight.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:59.410
But do you think he's okay with this, Kazuno?

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:00.680
Judge.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:02.740
He was enjoying himself.

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:04.750
It was an appropriate farewell.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.290
I see.

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:10.110
I fail to see what you are thinking,

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:13.180
but I shall serve you until the very end.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:17.710
Commence operations
and watch the show as our lord.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:23.580
Enjoy Mikawa's final fireworks,
which will turn the world against us.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:30.460
6:59 P.M.
Kakamigahara, Mikawa

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:35.660
Go!

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:48.420
B1T3 to B2T3.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.240
We're on duty, so no standing.

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:51.610
I can see you from here!

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:53.380
What's wrong?

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:58.820
What?!

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:08.440
I dealt with B2T3.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.650
I believe the results were favorable.

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:13.440
I dealt with B1T3, same results.

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:25.890
7:44 P.M.
Tea House Next to Sakakibara Manor

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.960
Master Sakai, this is for you.

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:29.200
Oh, thanks.

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.250
Where's Sakakibara?

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:31.460
Judge.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:33.450
Before he began working on the materials,

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:36.160
he ordered me to deliver them to you later,

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:37.590
which is what I have done.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:39.720
Did he forget something?

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:42.060
It's blank!

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.380
Dammit!

00:09:44.990 --> 00:09:46.390
Master Sakai?

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:49.150
Please pursue the kidnappers.

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.280
It's okay,

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:56.600
I believe the Four Divine Matsudaira Kings
will always be together.

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:00.680
7:51 P.M.
Sakakibara Manor Study

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:00.950
Sakakibara!

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:09.680
The master isn't in,
so I believe he has finished work.

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:12.810
I would like to begin cleaning the room.

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.980
Not you too, Sakakibara...

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:29.400
Pursue the Nikyou Crest

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:29.400
"Pursue the Nikyou Crest"?

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.110
Genesis Project

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:36.430
"Genesis Project"?

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:38.860
"Pursue the kidnappers"?

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:42.510
7:53 P.M.
Musashi Ariadust Academy

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.340
Go, go!

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.160
Ne..Nenji!

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:52.710
I bet the Chancellor had a hand in all this.

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:59.230
Honestly, what was he thinking?

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:00.470
W..Water...

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.650
What's going on here?!

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:07.040
Who dared to bring such chaos upon my town?!

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:11.900
Speak now if you wish to say something.

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:16.040
Suzu!

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:18.570
Whoa! Warning! Warning!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.660
He made Musashi's precious image of cute bangs cry!

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:24.870
H..Hey! Chancellor and President!

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:27.160
Is this insanity your doing?!

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:29.200
You get the death sentence!

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:33.130
O..Over there...

00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:39.900
Think there was an accident at the
Testament Union's guard post?

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:43.840
Divine Contact

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:40.950
I can't say.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:43.840
I tried contacting the Chamber of Commerce,
but I can't get through.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.220
Let's break for now!

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:52.910
Wait!

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:00.240
Me?

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:01.640
Behind...

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.850
Behind you! Behind you!

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:05.900
Behind me?

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:11.370
A girl?

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.050
Sh..She's transparent!

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:17.640
Papa's gone.

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:20.130
I can't find Mama.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.090
It...

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.050
It...

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:25.090
It's a ghost!

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:32.750
7:57 P.M.
In Front of Sakakibara Manor

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.270
The Kakamigahara Guard Post?

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:45.760
Dacchan?

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:50.040
You sure have aged if you couldn't dodge that!

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.250
Slicing Dragonfly?

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:55.530
That's a Shinto weapon!

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:13.840
Hey, that noise!

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:15.140
Is it the ground?

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.640
No, it's from deeper down!

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:18.810
It's...

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:21.430
The Earth's plates.

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:23.740
Is it the Shin-Nagoya Platonic Plate Reactor?

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.410
What are you doing?!

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:26.950
We're starting a meltdown.

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:28.200
You're what?!

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:31.560
7:59 P.M.
Shin-Nagoya Castle, Mikawa

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:34.100
7:59 P.M.
Central Unification Reactor, Mikawa

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:43.440
That will destroy all of Mikawa, not just Nagoya!

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.500
No one is left in Mikawa.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.470
It's just the automated dolls and us.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.180
What did you discover?

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:53.390
I'm in the dark.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.400
Our lord has only informed me that

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:58.020
this is the beginning of the Genesis Project.

00:13:58.170 --> 00:13:58.920
Genesis Project

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:01.360
The Genesis Project?

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:05.360
I know that it could potentially save us all.

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:09.880
I wouldn't!

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:10.820
I'll bind you!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.230
You'd bind me?

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:15.850
Slicing Dragonfly can sever things from existence.

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:17.940
Is the Kakamigahara Guard Post burning...

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:20.080
Because I severed the guards' very existence.

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:22.670
Dacchan, why?!

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:24.450
Go, Sakai.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:27.610
I don't have time to fiddle with you.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:31.430
Kazuno and I must intercept those
Testament Union bastards.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:34.100
Moron, they'll kill you!

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:35.430
I don't care.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:39.140
My display of loyalty is to protect
my lord's wishes and prevail.

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:43.810
So Tadatsugu, how does your loyalty stand?

00:14:43.810 --> 00:14:46.440
Isn't it to see what happens next?

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:51.160
So go, you no longer belong here.

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:53.660
Dacchan!

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:56.930
What about your daughter?

00:14:57.480 --> 00:14:59.000
Dacchan!

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:37.750
What's that?

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:42.300
We've reached a stop and shall begin turning back.

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:45.630
Fluid output erupting from
Shin-Nagoya Castle is increasing.

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:47.400
Detection levels have increased a notch.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:49.720
Tres España's armed guard is taking action.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.450
A fleet of landing craft are approaching Mikawa.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:57.560
K.P.A. Italia has put our call on
hold rather than block it.

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:01.000
The Testament Union ships dispatched the

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.820
Gods of War and commenced an assault.

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:04.770
Let them make their move.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:05.710
Ma'am?

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:09.460
They'd use anti-aerial mountain gear
for putting out a fire.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:12.340
But if this was all just a feint...

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.240
You don't think Mikawa is...

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:20.400
This way the Testament Union can force
their armament into Mikawa.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:21.960
Lady Futayo!

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:26.210
What would you have us do?

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.590
Could you gather all officers on the ship?

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:31.840
Judge!

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:40.220
"Do as you like," eh, Father?

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.770
He wanted me to handle this myself.

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:47.480
What would Masazumi do?

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:52.300
8:01 P.M.
Deck Bow, Tama

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.110
Isn't that...

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:53.070
Have the fireworks begun?

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.430
Fireworks? Fireworks?

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:01.250
No, that isn't a firework.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.870
So, no fireworks?

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.330
Too bad, so sad!

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:05.540
Judge.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.250
We need to get away from here.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.170
And go where?

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:14.470
We might learn something if we drop by Blue Thunder.

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:16.680
Later!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:43.060
I suddenly lost power!

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:45.120
That light absorbs our power if you touch it!

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:47.470
Damn, how do we handle that?!

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:48.670
Notice from Base-1:

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:53.100
It has been proposed that the Gods of War
pave the way for the unit

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:56.320
ordered to destroy the Platonic Plate
Reactor in Shin-Nagoya Castle.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.510
But we're in anti-aerial gear!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.540
We will send backup.

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:01.560
Tes.!

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:05.390
A1 and A2 are to charge in.

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:07.670
A3 is to collect information and offer backup.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:08.730
Tes.!

00:18:09.840 --> 00:18:13.260
8:01 P.M.
Prefecture Highway 79, Mikawa

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:25.650
One down.

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:37.080
What happened, Zaragoza?

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.090
You're losing altitude!

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:42.300
H..HQ, we were fired upon from the ground.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:45.100
An automated doll fired at us!

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:48.390
It's Kazuno from Mikawa's Honda clan!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:54.860
Horned witch!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:56.860
Swords at my command!

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:13.290
A shield before me!

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:15.510
Increase numbers.

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:38.650
Re-form!

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:57.800
Hurry it up! We're running out of time.

00:19:58.140 --> 00:19:59.210
I know!

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:05.470
It doesn't make sense.

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:06.350
Excuse me?

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:08.650
Why would the people of Mikawa make

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:10.440
the Platonic Plate Reactor meltdown

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:13.020
when it could destroy all of Mikawa?

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:16.460
Master Muneshige, only Mikawa's locals

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:18.530
know the answer to that.

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:22.280
Then, I'll have to ask one.

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:28.490
Isn't that pretty?

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:31.750
Are these Lord Motonobu's "fireworks"?

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.460
But this is...

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:36.380
This is a man-made meltdown!

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:40.310
Our communications indicate
Mikawa's automated dolls

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:42.010
are rising against the Testament Union.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:45.970
I bet Kazuno is leading the rebellion.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.000
That means my father,

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:50.210
Tadakatsu, is inevitably involved in this.

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:53.070
Lady Futayo, we could use this ship

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:54.730
to help aid Sir Tadakatsu.

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:57.520
We must decide what course of action is

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:00.300
most beneficial for the Far East.

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.110
Any opinions on this?

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:02.990
Ma'am!

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:06.790
If Mikawa intentionally started the meltdown,

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:09.700
the Testament Union will revoke its position as

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:12.440
the Far East's representative
and lay claim on Musashi.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:14.000
They would gain a great

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.880
deal if they overtook the Far East and Musashi.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:21.130
The worst-case scenario for us
is the best-case for them.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:27.070
So, we're the only ones
who can stand between Musashi

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:28.640
and the Testament Union.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:30.540
We've had little contact with Musashi

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:32.470
because we're from Mikawa.

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:34.540
Lady Futayo?

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:39.030
Right now, we should stay on standby

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:40.570
and remain completely neutral.

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:44.150
But doesn't that betray what is in your heart?

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:44.900
Judge.

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:49.740
Loyalty is only given meaning through one's actions.

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:53.150
Very well.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:56.680
Head of Communications,
contact the Testament Union.

00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:59.520
Tell them we wish to help in the
event of an emergency.

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:00.260
Judge!

00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:01.370
Entering standby!

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:02.770
Await word from the Testament Union!

00:22:02.770 --> 00:22:04.380
Got that? We're on standby!

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:05.290
Judge!

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:26.570
That night, our world began to change.

00:22:26.890 --> 00:22:28.860
When I awoke this morning,

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:31.830
I thought this world would never change.

00:22:32.710 --> 00:22:36.540
The days I thought would last forever drew to an end,

00:22:37.010 --> 00:22:40.290
as we embarked on a journey with no return.

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:45.340
Not that I knew that back then.

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:54.560
Kizu darake no yuuki wo daite aruki dasu yo

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:54.560
I embrace my battered courage as I step forward

00:22:54.840 --> 00:23:02.860
Kono te de asu wo tsukuri dasu to kimeta kara

00:22:54.840 --> 00:23:02.860
I have decided to forge tomorrow with my own hands

00:23:03.990 --> 00:23:08.350
Saa, hoshi yo, terashite

00:23:03.990 --> 00:23:08.350
Oh, stars, shine upon

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:13.010
Koko ni ima umareta melody

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:13.010
The melody that was just born here

00:23:13.010 --> 00:23:17.510
Sono egao wo tonari de

00:23:13.010 --> 00:23:17.510
I would like to see that

00:23:17.820 --> 00:23:21.480
Mite itai to omoun da

00:23:17.820 --> 00:23:21.480
Smile of yours up close

00:23:22.280 --> 00:23:31.210
Itami ni tsuranukarete, kimi no na wo sakenda

00:23:22.280 --> 00:23:31.210
Piercing with pain, I screamed out your name

00:23:31.210 --> 00:23:41.240
Mada tooi kyoukai no ue de itsuka tsutaetai

00:23:31.210 --> 00:23:41.240
Someday I wish to tell you something on the horizon

00:23:40.070 --> 00:23:44.560
Itoshisa no fiore...

00:23:40.070 --> 00:23:44.560
My precious fiore...

00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:11.090
Next Episode
Graduates Under the Moon
